<title>USA: Casino Airlink Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Casino Airlink Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			 1996</p>
<p> Net Operating Revenues    $5,443,622		  $5,386,261</p>
<p> Net Earnings		     308,590			74,092</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		  0.03			  0.02</p>
<p> Common Shares Outstanding  8,999,000		   3,000,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the incease in Q1 1997 net income was due to increased passenger loads.</p>
<p>Full name is Casino Airlink Inc.</p>
